.DS_Store

# Bare `go build ./cmd/spivot-server` from the repo root drops the
# compiled binary here named after the package dir. Releases build into
# dist/ (already ignored); this guards the ad-hoc root-level artifact so
# a 17 MB binary never gets committed by accident. Leading slash anchors
# to the repo root, so it does not match the cmd/spivot-server/ source dir.
/spivot-server
